        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-20524-21366"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20527-20551"><rb>此後</rb><rt>こののち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20551-20554">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20554-20584"><rb>杉村氏</rb><rt>すぎむらし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20584-20590">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20590-20632"><rb>東京朝日</rb><rt>とうきやうあさひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20632-20635">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20635-20656"><rb>世界</rb><rt>せかい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20656-20659">一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20659-20677"><rb>周</rb><rt>しう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20677-20704"><rb>會員</rb><rt>くわいゐん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20704-20707">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20707-20722"><rb>共</rb><rt>とも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20722-20728">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20728-20752"><rb>米國</rb><rt>べいこく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20752-20755">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20755-20770"><rb>渡</rb><rt>わた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20770-20794">り、ボストンにて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20794-20809"><rb>圖</rb><rt>はか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20809-20827">らずモールス</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20827-20839"><rb>氏</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20839-20842">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20842-20869"><rb>面會</rb><rt>めんくわい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20869-20875">し、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20875-20893"><rb>余等</rb><rt>よら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20893-20896">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20896-20911"><rb>共</rb><rt>とも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20911-20914">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source